{"id":"peuple","lemma":"peuple","pos":"noun","rank":735,"glosses":["people (nation, distinct ethnic group)","the people, the general population, the common folk"],"ipa":"/pœpl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fa/Fr-peuple.ogg/Fr-peuple.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"peuples"},"formAudio":{"peuples":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-peuples.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il était un dieu pour son peuple.","en":"He was a god to his people.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"a god, male divinity"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Le peuple aime la liberté.","en":"People love freedom.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"freedom, liberty"}]},{"text":"Le roi oppressait son peuple.","en":"The king oppressed his people.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"king"},null,{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Le peuple s'est révolté contre le roi.","en":"People rose in revolt against the king.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to revolt","l":"révolter"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"king"}]},{"text":"La guerre a unifié le peuple américain.","en":"The war had united the American people.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"war"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to unify","l":"unifier"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of or pertaining to…"}]}]}